CHECK name=the old body's straddling-pair error law fires and has no exception ok=1 n=5612 every pair whose members have opposite signs was returned as 2^32+1-d rather than d, signed zeros included (they are the pair whose true distance the format fixes at 1, so this class is checkable without trusting either ruler)
CHECK name=the old body is the IDENTITY on same-sign pairs, which is why no band moved ok=1 n=283556 283556 same-sign pairs, 0 of them measured wrong by the old body — if that second number were not 0 the bands would have been wrong for a second, unrelated reason
