CHECK name=re-running the probe with the old body moves no band on this artifact ok=1 n=10 bands that moved: none — a non-empty list means the figure contained a pair whose members have opposite signs, and the fix is to re-derive and re-examine the verdicts that quote it, never to widen a band by hand
CHECK name=the table on disk is the table this probe just derived ok=1 n=10 work/oracle_floor.tsv must be the probe's own output (name, comparisons, max_ulp, straddling, signed-zero) and not a hand-edited band file
