CHECK name=logit_dot_route_ulp is a same-sign measurement, shown rather than stated ok=1 n=0 0 straddling pairs in 131072 comparisons of that band's own population, recomputed here from the bit images rather than read from oracle_arm.pair_census; the band's own value is second evidence, because a straddle of size d would have been reported as 2^32+1-d
CHECK name=the straddling twin prints what the old body WOULD have said, by the complement law ok=1 n=2355560448 the band's own widest pair with one member negated: the ruler and the repaired body say 1939406849, the historic body said 2355560448 = 2^32+1-1939406849 — an order reversal about zero, not a rounding nudge
RESULT PASS oracle ruler repair witness checks=13 findings=0
